                    "sense_definition": "Present participle and gerund of <w>crumple</w>.",
                    "learner_level": "B2",
                    "frequency": "Middle",
                    "semantic_group_id": "action",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "He was <w>crumpling</w> the letter in his hand while he read it.",
